{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-5","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"简介\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/readme/section-intro-dark.png\"><img src=\"assets/readme/section-intro-light.png\" alt=\"INTRO · 简介\" width=\"1440\"></picture></h2>\n\n把本机 **Wallpaper Engine** 的 Scene、Web 与视频壁纸带进 DSH 对话界面，再配上液态玻璃、字体、吉祥物与可分享的外观预设。插件不向 agent 注册工具、不注入提示文本，**不增加模型 token 开销**。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
