{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-10","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：- **壁纸**：Scene / Web 实时渲染，Video 直接播放；支持自定义图片 / 视频上传与 WE 项目目录。\n- **外观**：设置窗、对话区与侧栏液态玻璃；配色、透明度、模糊、边框与字体可调。\n- **玻璃子包**：液态玻璃是独立子包行 `wallpaper-engine-glass`，可在插件管理器单独停用；停用后，除内容区壁纸外界面回到宿中原生外观，壁纸、字体与吉祥物等功能不受影响。\n- **扩展**：吉祥物、会话头像、点击 / 拖尾特效、3D 视差；可选桌宠联动 [dsh-pet-dshwe](https://github.com/Fish-under-sea/dsh-pet-dshwe)（dsh-pet 全量 fork），设置页卡片可一键安装，未装 / 关闭 / 版本过旧时回落原生吉祥物。\n- **壁纸库**：筛选、隐藏 / 恢复、自动轮播；外观预设整套导入导出。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-11","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：<h2 id=\"支持哪些壁纸\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/readme/section-formats-dark.png\"><img src=\"assets/readme/section-formats-light.png\" alt=\"支持哪些壁纸类型\" width=\"1440\"></picture></h2>","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-12","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：| 类型 | 在 DSH 中的路径 | 支持情况 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Scene（场景）** | 内置 WebWallGL 实时渲染，失败时按降级链回退 | 支持，不需要 WE 在后台运行 |\n| **Web（网页）** | 网页挂载、WE API 注入与沙箱隔离 | 支持；效果取决于网页与浏览器能力 |\n| **Video（视频）** | 浏览器播放，配合转码、帧率上限与暂停控制 | 支持 |\n| **Picture（图片 / 幻灯片项目）** | 读取 WE `preset` 项目的图片目录，按 WE 里设的周期在本机交叉淡化轮播 | 支持；图片不上传、留在本机 |\n| **自定义图片 / 视频** | 上传本地 JPG / PNG / MP4 | 支持，文件保存在本机 |\n\nApplication（应用）类壁纸需要启动第三方程序，**不支持**，也不会进入壁纸库或轮播候选。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-13","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：<h2 id=\"快速开始\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/readme/section-start-dark.png\"><img src=\"assets/readme/section-start-light.png\" alt=\"快速开始\" width=\"1440\"></picture></h2>\n\n前置：**Node.js >= 22.12.0**、**DSH 0.2 内核**（含 `0.2.0-rc.1/rc.2`）与 **pnpm**。安装前完全退出 DSH。\n\n**npm（推荐）**\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine\n```\n\n桌面端把 `web` 改为 `desktop`。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-14","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：本仓按**多包发布集**发布：主包与同版本子包一起解析（具体包数、tarball 数与 `publishOrder` 见[发布说明](docs/RELEASING.md)，各版本变化见[变更记录](docs/CHANGELOG.md)）。\n\n**源码**\n\n```sh\nnode scripts/install-source.mjs --profile desktop --dsh-home \"<DSH 数据目录>\" --app-closed\n```\n\n源码安装会构建客户端并注册主包与子包；安装后不要移动或删除源码目录。完整说明见 [安装与升级](docs/UPGRADING.md) 与 [贡献指南](CONTRIBUTING.md)；没有命令行经验请先看 [入门指南](README.beginner.md)。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-15","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：<h2 id=\"使用\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/readme/section-usage-dark.png\"><img src=\"assets/readme/section-usage-light.png\" alt=\"使用\" width=\"1440\"></picture></h2>\n\n1. 打开 **设置 → Wallpaper Engine → 壁纸库**，或在聊天顶部从吉祥物拉绳进入壁纸仓库。\n2. 在页内壁纸库选择缩略图，按需调整播放与外观；修改即时生效并保存到宿主端。\n3. 暂停 / 播放只控制当前播放；清除当前壁纸不会删除原文件。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-16","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：<a href=\"https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine/releases/download/media-v1/settings-ui.gif\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine/releases/download/media-v1/settings-ui.gif\" alt=\"设置界面功能展示\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine/releases/download/media-v1/wallpaper-library.gif\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine/releases/download/media-v1/wallpaper-library.gif\" alt=\"壁纸库与壁纸仓库\">\n</a>","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-17","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：<h2 id=\"兼容与限制\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/readme/section-compat-dark.png\"><img src=\"assets/readme/section-compat-light.png\" alt=\"兼容与限制\" width=\"1440\"></picture></h2>\n\n- Windows / macOS / Linux 使用同一份源码；macOS 没有 WE 客户端，可上传图片 / 视频或指向 WE 项目目录。\n- Scene 渲染依赖浏览器 WebGL 与显卡驱动，复杂工坊项目可能存在兼容差异；失败会逐级降级。\n- 遮挡暂停、窗口失焦暂停与音频回环采集按平台适配；在线歌词默认关闭。\n- 与其他皮肤 / 插件同时启用时，先看 [共存说明](docs/HOW-IT-WORKS.md#共存玻璃表面与其他-ui-插件)。","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
