{"unit_id":"elysia395__dsh-wallpaper-engine#readme-29","repo":"elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine","commit":"3d6a272e7b547509d411760f05d37f691d02f567","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine README · Introduction：</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"intro\">Intro</h2>\n\nBring local **Wallpaper Engine** Scene, Web and Video wallpapers into DSH, with liquid glass, typography, mascots and shareable appearance presets. The plugin registers no agent tools or prompt text, so it adds no model token overhead.","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
